## R1 REQ-M3: production-flow wiring (rework-1, 2026-10-28, branch fix/77-mission-gates-r1)

Prior state (verified before touching): check_recovery_dismissal /
snapshot_row_state / RecoveryDismissalRefused were defined in
scripts/sweep-typed-blocks.py but invoked NOWHERE in the production sweep
or any recovery-close path — call sites were tests/test_mission_gates.py
(unit-level) and the V29 block in scripts/verify-rigs.sh only. Dead code
in production = REQ-M3 spec-conformance defect ("WHEN something attempts
to close the recovery item THEN the close is refused" had no production
caller). No close hook existed: check_allowed refuses every queue write
except unpark-to-in-progress, and D2 forbids any bot close-to-done.

Wiring applied (minimal, behavior-preserving): run_sweep retains
report["recovery_guards"][qid] = {flagged_qitem, flagged_snapshot} for
each evaluated stay-blocked row (read-only retention; unpark/stay-blocked
paths untouched); new request_recovery_dismissal(client, recovery_id,
flagged_qitem, flagged_snapshot) re-reads the flagged row via
client.fetch_show, invokes the guard, logs, returns-or-raises, performs
no write (unreadable row fails closed). E2E proof: 3 tests in
TestProductionRecoveryWiring drive run_sweep -> retained snapshot ->
close-time gate (refused-while-frozen with zero writes,
permitted-once-moved, refused-when-unreadable).

### R1-a guard neutered -> production-flow dismissal SUCCEEDS (RED)

Sabotage: `if current_snapshot == flagged_snapshot:` -> `... and False:`
in check_recovery_dismissal (sweep copy restored byte-identical after).

```
AssertionError: RecoveryDismissalRefused not raised
Ran 3 tests / FAILED (failures=1)
```

The e2e refusal test goes RED (identical snapshots permitted through the
retained-snapshot -> close-time-gate path) — proving the wired production
flow refuses BECAUSE of the guard, not incidentally.

GREEN (restored, byte-identical copy): Ran 19 tests / OK
(tests.test_mission_gates, incl. 3 TestProductionRecoveryWiring).

### R1-b retention removed -> close-time gate has no snapshot (RED)

Sabotage: the 5-line `report["recovery_guards"][qid] = {...}` retention
