GREEN (restored, byte-identical copy): Ran 19 tests / OK.
`git status --short` shows only the four intended files
(docs runbook + qa, scripts/sweep-typed-blocks.py,
tests/test_mission_gates.py); sweep file diffed byte-identical to the
pre-sabotage copy before proceeding.

